2026-07-27T06:40:52.6487957Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T06:40:52.6548641Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T06:40:52.6549277Z i /tmp/RtmpUNZPM4/duckdb
2026-07-27T06:40:52.6549729Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T06:40:52.6550263Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T06:40:52.6551046Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T06:40:52.6552156Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T06:40:52.6553191Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T06:40:52.6553978Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T06:40:52.6788454Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:40:52.6900523Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:40:52.7331599Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:40:52.7493273Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
